{
 "lang": "en",
 "duration": 53.5234375,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.86,
   "text": "If you try to eliminate your unhappiness,"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.98,
   "end": 3.44,
   "text": "you will eliminate your happiness."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.6,
   "end": 5.84,
   "text": "You never wanna eliminate your suffering."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.04,
   "end": 7.52,
   "text": "That's the worst possible technique"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.52,
   "end": 9.12,
   "text": "for mental health, happiness and wellness."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.42,
   "end": 11.2,
   "text": "Suffering is a sacred part of life."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.28,
   "end": 12.06,
   "text": "It's your teacher."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.2,
   "end": 14.32,
   "text": "I talk about unhappiness as I talk about happiness"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.32,
   "end": 16.1,
   "text": "and I believe in unhappiness."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.2,
   "end": 18.06,
   "text": "I'm a big fan of unhappiness"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.06,
   "end": 19.34,
   "text": "because you're not gonna live life."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.36,
   "end": 21.12,
   "text": "And the biggest problem for young people today"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.12,
   "end": 22.6,
   "text": "is they go to the campus counseling center"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.6,
   "end": 24.04,
   "text": "and say, I still feel sad and anxious."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.12,
   "end": 25.16,
   "text": "They say, well, we gotta fix that."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.22,
   "end": 27.9,
   "text": "That's bad because if you try to eliminate"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.9,
   "end": 30.18,
   "text": "your unhappiness, you will eliminate your happiness."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.48,
   "end": 32.96,
   "text": "You will be not experiencing a full range of emotion."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.22,
   "end": 35.06,
   "text": "You'll feel bad about your emotions"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.06,
   "end": 36.7,
   "text": "and you will not learn and grow"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.7,
   "end": 37.96,
   "text": "from your negative experiences."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.14,
   "end": 40.22,
   "text": "So you need to understand how to manage that."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.34,
   "end": 41.7,
   "text": "And there's lots of ways to do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.74,
   "end": 43.1,
   "text": "For me, it's prayer and fasting."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.24,
   "end": 44.22,
   "text": "Some people's therapy."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.34,
   "end": 46.02,
   "text": "For some people, it's actually really valuable."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.14,
   "end": 49.42,
   "text": "For some people, it's Vipassana insight meditation"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.42,
   "end": 51.78,
   "text": "for self-management of emotion."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.96,
   "end": 53.5,
   "text": "But you have to get good at it."
  }
 ],
